WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.083
<i>Do you know what it is
to make your dreams come true, Leo?</i>

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:08.541
<i>I've seen you working downstairs.</i>

00:00:09.166 --> 00:00:10.125
<i>You're a good man.</i>

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:16.374
But the barman should not
punch the fucking customers.

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:21.083
<i>I don't deserve you, Leo.</i>

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.833
I love you so much,
but you don't know me.

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:31.958
<i>I want to know what the deal is
with this crazy bartender.</i>

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:34.166
Sure you want our help with this?

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:37.250 position:61%
<i>This kind of thing hurts my reputation.</i>

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:39.708
Daddy's gotta go.

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:41.666
No soda.

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:49.125
<i>Your girlfriend has secrets.</i>

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:55.958 position:64%
You lost, mate? Take a hint and fuck off.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.458
Not very talkative.

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:03.458
Something's going on.

00:01:04.499 --> 00:01:06.458
You need to maintain
a sense of humor, babe.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.291 position:63%
You gonna give me some trouble, big boy,

00:01:14.375 --> 00:01:17.166
or are you gonna channel
that famous Amish serenity?

00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:21.416
<i>Leo...</i>

00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:24.166
<i>I need to tell you something.</i>

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:28.416
<i>This is gonna stop right now.</i>

00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:29.875
It ain't a secret anymore.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.083
<i>Would you do anything for her?</i>

00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:37.000
Say you're sorry.
Fucking say it!

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.208
<i>Why the hell can't he talk?</i>

00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:42.375
<i>He doesn't need words.</i>

